{"id": "unknown-2026-11-13-009", "date": "2026-11-13", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["installation_demand", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Malaysia extends residential solar rebates for approved applicants", "content": "<p>Malaysia's residential solar rebate scheme has MYS 90 million ($22.1 million) remaining. Approved applicants will now be given until March 2027 to complete their PV installations and claim rebates.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/13/malaysia-extends-residential-solar-rebates-for-approved-applicants/\">Malaysia extends residential solar rebates for approved applicants</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/13/malaysia-extends-residential-solar-rebates-for-approved-applicants/", "type": "rss"}]}
